    "summary": "Added src/daemon/threads/step-state.ts: SharedStepStateStore with today's per-kind lifecycles (LocalStepStateStore on the main thread: 100-entry cap evicting the least recently touched, 1-hour idle TTL swept on mint, read refreshing the expiry; analyze and workflow rotate tokens, review keeps its token and requires it to exist, code-review consumes and mints per stage), payloads stored as a structured clone; stepStateHubHandlers and HubStepStateStore so a worker uses the same interface over the hub; getStepStateStore/installStepStateStore. Nothing calls it yet (t8/t9 move the four state-store modules onto it). Tests in src/daemon/threads/__tests__/step-state.test.ts, including real workers, a payload of each kind crossing the hub unchanged, an unclonable payload failing with DataCloneError, and state minted in one worker read by another after the first exits. Four lifecycle mutations each fail the lifecycle test.",
